{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/golf-vale-emaar-properties-emaar-south","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1440,"crm_id":"7885","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"Golf Vale","slug":"golf-vale-emaar-properties-emaar-south","display_address":"Emaar South","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2030","developer":"Emaar Properties","price":1100000,"display_price":"1.10M","lattitude":24.863197078999,"longitude":55.140923119998,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Golf Vale in <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/emaar-south/\">Emaar South Dubai</a> is a modern residential development by Emaar Properties. Located in located in <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/dubai-south/\">Dubai South</a>, it features 262 residences including <strong>1, 2, and 3-bedroom apartments and 3-bedroom townhouses,</strong> designed around green landscapes and golf course views. Investors can secure a home with a 10% down payment while benefiting from strong long-term capital appreciation potential.</p><p>Golf Vale by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-emaar-properties/\">Emaar Properties</a> presents a golf-inspired lifestyle with thoughtfully designed homes that combine contemporary architecture and refined interiors. Residents will enjoy a selection of lifestyle amenities including an 18-hole golf course, infinity edge pool, gym, and yoga areas, all set within a landscaped community designed for relaxation, recreation, and active living.&nbsp;</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Feature_5faf1b28ca.jpg","hash":"Feature_5faf1b28ca","name":"Feature.jpg