"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<ul><li>Prime Dubai South Connectivity – Located near Emirates Road with seamless access to airports, Expo City, and Dubai’s major lifestyle districts.</li><li>Golf-Inspired Residential Community – Set around landscaped greenery and an 18-hole championship golf course creating scenic views and a tranquil atmosphere.</li><li>Diverse Residential Options – Featuring 1, 2, and 3-bedroom apartments along with spacious 3-bedroom townhouses for modern family living.</li><li>Developed by a Global Real Estate Leader – Created by Emaar Properties, known for delivering landmark communities and premium lifestyle destinations worldwide.</li><li>Strong Investment Potential – Positioned in a growing district with high capital appreciation prospects driven by infrastructure and community development.</li><li>Lifestyle-Focused Amenities – Infinity edge pool, yoga areas, gym, and recreational facilities designed to promote wellness and leisure.</li><li>Accessible Payment Structure – A flexible 80/20 payment plan allows buyers to invest progressively during construction.</li><li>10% Down Payment Opportunity – Buyers can secure a residence in a premium Emaar community with a relatively low initial investment.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":2123,"cta":{"id":2961,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Map_Location_8fd8f82ea6.jpg","hash":"Map_Location_8fd8f82ea6","name":"Map-Location.jpg"},"style":null,"title":"Well-Connected Living Near Key Destinations Across Dubai","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>The Golf Vale Emaar South location places residents within Dubai South, close to Emirates Road (E611). This strategic positioning ensures smooth connectivity to major